data: {"id": "a94405013c094c64-thinking-parallel_evidence-1816", "run_id": "a94405013c094c64", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 5. 补证结果分析\n\n### 5.1 Pod Describe 新发现 (关键证据)\n\n- **真实状态**: `Pending` (尽管上游报告为 ContainerCreating，但 describe 显示 Pending，通常 CNI 失败会导致沙箱创建失败，进而回到 Pending)。\n- **关键注解**: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`\n- **关键事件**: \n  - `Reason: FailedCreatePodSandBox`\n  - `Message: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found`\n- **原因确认**: Pod 使用了 **Multus CNI**，引用了一个名为 `u", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788781092346, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

